@startuml Coffee Order Service - Sequence Diagram

actor "Customer/Staff" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "AuthController" as Auth
participant "JwtAuthFilter" as JWTFilter
participant "OrderController" as OrderCtrl
participant "OrderService" as OrderSvc
database "Database" as DB

== Authentication Flow ==
User -> FE: Login Request
FE -> Auth: POST /api/auth/login
Auth -> DB: Validate Credentials
DB --> Auth: User Details
Auth -> Auth: Generate JWT Token
Auth --> FE: JWT Token Response
FE -> FE: Store Token

== Place Order Flow ==
User -> FE: Place Order Request
FE -> JWTFilter: Request with JWT
JWTFilter -> JWTFilter: Validate Token
JWTFilter -> OrderCtrl: POST /api/orders
OrderCtrl -> OrderSvc: placeOrder()
OrderSvc -> DB: Check Shop Status
DB --> OrderSvc: Shop Details
OrderSvc -> DB: Find Available Queue
DB --> OrderSvc: Queue Details
OrderSvc -> DB: Save Order
DB --> OrderSvc: Order Details
OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: Calculate ETA
OrderSvc --> OrderCtrl: Order Response
OrderCtrl --> FE: Order Details with Queue Position
FE --> User: Order Confirmation

== Check Order Status Flow ==
User -> FE: Check Order Status
FE -> JWTFilter: Request with JWT
JWTFilter -> JWTFilter: Validate Token
JWTFilter -> OrderCtrl: GET /api/orders/{orderId}
OrderCtrl -> OrderSvc: getOrderDetailsById()
OrderSvc -> DB: Fetch Order
DB --> OrderSvc: Order Details
OrderSvc --> OrderCtrl: Order Status
OrderCtrl --> FE: Order Status Response
FE --> User: Display Order Status

== Check Queue Position Flow ==
User -> FE: Check Queue Position
FE -> JWTFilter: Request with JWT
JWTFilter -> JWTFilter: Validate Token
JWTFilter -> OrderCtrl: GET /api/orders/{orderId}/queue-position
OrderCtrl -> OrderSvc: getCurrentQueuePosition()
OrderSvc -> DB: Fetch Order & Queue
DB --> OrderSvc: Order & Queue Details
OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: Calculate Updated ETA
OrderSvc --> OrderCtrl: Queue Position & ETA
OrderCtrl --> FE: Queue Position Response
FE --> User: Display Position & ETA

== Update Order Status Flow (Staff Only) ==
User -> FE: Update Order Status
FE -> JWTFilter: Request with JWT
JWTFilter -> JWTFilter: Validate Token & Role
JWTFilter -> OrderCtrl: POST /api/orders/status
OrderCtrl -> OrderSvc: changeOrderStatusById()
OrderSvc -> DB: Update Order Status
alt Order Completed/Cancelled
    OrderSvc -> DB: Update Queue
    OrderSvc -> DB: Reorder Queue Positions
end
DB --> OrderSvc: Updated Order
OrderSvc --> OrderCtrl: Status Update Response
OrderCtrl --> FE: Success Response
FE --> User: Status Update Confirmation

@enduml 